- Production Signatures: Gritty 12-bit drum sampler crunch saturated through 1960s EMI TG-series tube consoles; dual screaming Vox Continental and Farfisa Compact Duo synth keys layered with authentic Mellotron Mk II tapes; micro-sampled symphonic stabs punched in live like b-boy battle munitions.
- Dynamics: Sweeping, delicate harpsichord and chamber-woodwind overtures that suddenly detonate into colossal, full-ensemble groove explosions, dropping away to bare upright basslines before rebuilding toward ecstatic, multi-voiced choral climaxes.

